{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里短暂地轻快舒展，喜欢也显得自在。尝过克制的代价后，他这一刻松开了对自己的约束。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他体验到，短暂放松对渴望的控制，也能带来真实的轻快。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 9,\n      \"why\": \"这一解释紧扣前文克制开始带来代价的经历，也能说明此刻为何出现近乎释然的舒展感。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选11\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"这一次，他心里泛起柔软的感动，连欢喜都显得格外珍贵。亲近早已成了他的依靠，所以这份欢喜里也带着怕失去它的酸楚。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他体验到，亲近带来的欢喜越深，也越牵动自己对失去它的在意。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"明亮中带着触动的听感，与他对亲近的依赖及失去的切身恐惧相合，呈现的是珍惜带来的酸楚，而非单纯放松。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选12\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cdbb2391-b162-4d87-b767-94a0ed7ba823", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T022926968683Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.89, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:30:58.876208+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7b293297064c80dc9fb13ddbe2bc4e90dfd780d22e63194c49b26068b728f414", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca76761